WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.175
The code is one command, measure.

2
00:00:02.175 --> 00:00:06.858
It reads the exports, the HR separations,
the card system's revocations,

3
00:00:06.858 --> 00:00:10.653
Intune's device actions and
the privileged role holders,

4
00:00:10.653 --> 00:00:15.175
and writes the intervals, a summary
and the findings with a manifest.

5
00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:16.871
For each passed separation,

6
00:00:16.871 --> 00:00:20.412
blocked is the later of the
disable and the session update.

7
00:00:20.412 --> 00:00:25.426
Revoked is the latest of the block, the
card revocation and the last device action.

8
00:00:25.426 --> 00:00:28.688
A cancelled separation
is listed, not measured.

9
00:00:28.688 --> 00:00:33.380
One open point: Lab 2 confirms which
task writes the session update.
